 Roles in SmartLearn

🎓 Student
    Access student dashboard with enrolled courses and events
    Browse and enroll in courses
    Social feed — create posts, like, comment
    Study groups — create, join, leave, chat, reply, send images
    Direct messaging with other users
    View announcements
    View events and RSVP
    Cannot access admin panel


👨‍🏫 Teacher
    Access teacher dashboard with their courses and student stats
    Everything students can do

    Access admin panel with:
        Upload material (videos, PDFs, notes)
        Manage their courses
        Post announcements
        View social feed


    Cannot see:
        Users management
        Subscriptions management




⚙️ Admin
    Full access to everything
    Access admin panel with:

    Dashboard with full KPIs
        Upload material
        Manage all courses
        Manage all users (change roles, delete)
        Post announcements
        Manage subscriptions
        View social feed

    Auto-added to all study groups created by students
    Can delete any group or message